  ($id$potcoc-m-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-cociente$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\left(-\frac{2a^2}{3b}\right)^4$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{8a^8}{12b^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{16a^6}{81b^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{16a^8}{81b^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{16a^8}{81b^4}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Potencia par da positivo: $\frac{(-2)^4(a^2)^4}{3^4b^4} = \frac{16a^8}{81b^4}$.$exp$),
