  ($id$potpot-m-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $((u^2)^5)^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"u^{15}","correct":false},{"latex":"u^{25}","correct":false},{"latex":"u^{10}","correct":false},{"latex":"u^{30}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2 \cdot 5 \cdot 3 = 30$.$exp$),
