  ($id$potpot-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $((2^x)^y)^z$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2^{x+y+z}","correct":false},{"latex":"8^{xyz}","correct":false},{"latex":"2^{x^{yz}}","correct":false},{"latex":"2^{xyz}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Multiplicamos las tres potencias: $x \cdot y \cdot z = xyz$.$exp$),
