  ($id$potpro-m-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(6p^4q^3)^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"12p^6q^5","correct":false},{"latex":"6p^8q^6","correct":false},{"latex":"36p^6q^5","correct":false},{"latex":"36p^8q^6","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$6^2 = 36$, $p^{4 \cdot 2}=p^8$, $q^{3 \cdot 2}=q^6$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2x^2 y^3)^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"8x^6 y^9","correct":true},{"latex":"6x^6 y^9","correct":false},{"latex":"8x^5 y^6","correct":false},{"latex":"6x^5 y^6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2^3 = 8$, $(x^2)^3 = x^6$ y $(y^3)^3 = y^9$. Resultado: $8x^6 y^9$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(-2x^3 y)^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-8x^9 y^3","correct":true},{"latex":"8x^9 y^3","correct":false},{"latex":"-6x^9 y^3","correct":false},{"latex":"-8x^6 y^3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(-2)^3 = -8$ (exponente impar conserva el signo), $(x^3)^3 = x^9$ y $y^3$. Resultado: $-8x^9 y^3$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica y evalúa: $(2 \cdot 3)^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"36","correct":true},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"18","correct":false},{"latex":"72","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(2 \cdot 3)^2 = 2^2 \cdot 3^2 = 4 \cdot 9 = 36$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $(2x)^n = 8x^3$, ¿cuál es el valor de $n$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(2x)^3 = 2^3 x^3 = 8x^3$, por lo que $n = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(ab^2 c)^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"a^2 b^4 c^2","correct":true},{"latex":"a^2 b^4 c","correct":false},{"latex":"a^2 b^2 c^2","correct":false},{"latex":"ab^4 c^2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se reparte el exponente a todos: $a^2$, $(b^2)^2 = b^4$ y $c^2$. Resultado: $a^2 b^4 c^2$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2^n x^n y^{2n})^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4^n x^n y^{2n}","correct":false},{"latex":"2^{n+2} x^{2n} y^{4n}","correct":false},{"latex":"4^n x^{2n} y^{4n}","correct":true},{"latex":"2^{2n} x^{n^2} y^{4n^2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Elevamos al cuadrado cada factor: $(2^n)^2 = 2^{2n} = 4^n$, $x^{2n}$, $y^{4n}$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(-3x^{a+1}y^b)^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"27x^{3a+3}y^{3b}","correct":false},{"latex":"-9x^{3a+3}y^{3b}","correct":false},{"latex":"-27x^{3a+3}y^{3b}","correct":true},{"latex":"-27x^{a+4}y^{b+3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(-3)^3 = -27$, multiplicamos exponentes por 3: $3(a+1)=3a+3$, $3b$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(a^m b^n c^k)^p$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"a^{m+p}b^{n+p}c^{k+p}","correct":false},{"latex":"a^{mp}b^{np}c^{kp}","correct":true},{"latex":"p(a^mb^nc^k)","correct":false},{"latex":"a^{m^p}b^{n^p}c^{k^p}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se multiplica cada exponente por $p$: $a^{mp}b^{np}c^{kp}$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2^{k-1} x^{2k})^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2^{3k-1} x^{6k}","correct":false},{"latex":"8^k x^{6k}","correct":false},{"latex":"6^{k-1} x^{6k}","correct":false},{"latex":"8^{k-1} x^{6k}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(2^{k-1})^3 = 2^{3(k-1)} = (2^3)^{k-1} = 8^{k-1}$, y $x^{2k \cdot 3} = x^{6k}$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(-1)^n (x^2 y)^n$ cuando $n$ es par$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-x^{2n}y^n","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2n}y^n","correct":true},{"latex":"(-xy)^{3n}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2+n}y^{1+n}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Si $n$ es par, $(-1)^n = 1$, por lo que queda $x^{2n}y^n$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(5^{1/2} x^{3/2} y)^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"25x^3y^2","correct":false},{"latex":"5x^{9/4}y^2","correct":false},{"latex":"5x^3y^2","correct":true},{"latex":"5x^3y","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(5^{1/2})^2 = 5$, $(x^{3/2})^2 = x^3$, $y^2$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(x^{a-1} y^{b+1})^2 \cdot (x^2 y^{-1})$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^{2a-1} y^{2b}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2a} y^{2b}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2a+1} y^{2b+1}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2a} y^{2b+1}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Primero $(x^{a-1}y^{b+1})^2 = x^{2a-2}y^{2b+2}$. Luego sumamos exponentes: $x^{2a-2+2}y^{2b+2-1} = x^{2a}y^{2b+1}$.$exp$),
  ($id$potpro-h-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$potencia-producto$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(3^{-1} a^2 b^{-3})^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9}a^{-4}b^6","correct":false},{"latex":"9a^{-4}b^6","correct":true},{"latex":"9a^4b^{-6}","correct":false},{"latex":"3a^{-4}b^6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(3^{-1})^{-2} = 3^2 = 9$, $a^{2(-2)} = a^{-4}$, $b^{-3(-2)} = b^6$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $5^0$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"-5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Todo número distinto de cero elevado a la 0 es 1: $5^0 = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $x^0$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"x","correct":false},{"latex":"-x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Para cualquier $x \neq 0$: $x^0 = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(-3)^0$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"-1","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$La base completa (con su signo) elevada a la 0 es 1: $(-3)^0 = 1$.$exp$),
