  ($id$exp0-h-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(a^2 + b^2 + c^2)^0$ con $a,b,c \in \mathbb{R}$ no todos nulos$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"a^2+b^2+c^2","correct":false},{"latex":"a+b+c","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$La suma es estrictamente positiva, elevada a la 0 da 1.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{(3x+1)^0}{(2x-5)^0}$ para $x \neq 5/2, -1/3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"undefined","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{3x+1}{2x-5}","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{1} = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Para qué valor de $x$ NO está definida la expresión $x^0$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x = 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x = -1","correct":false},{"latex":"x = \\infty","correct":false},{"latex":"x = 0","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$0^0$ es una forma indeterminada en álgebra.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $5^{x-x} + 2^{y-y}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"7","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^0 + 2^0 = 1 + 1 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $(-1)^{2n} + (-1)^0$ con $n \in \mathbb{Z}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"-2","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(-1)^{2n} = 1$ (exponente par) y $(-1)^0 = 1$; suma $1+1=2$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(x^a \cdot x^{-a})^5$ con $x \neq 0$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^{10a}","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"x^5","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^{a-a} = x^0 = 1$, y $1^5 = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\left(\frac{a^3 b^2}{c^4}\right)^0 - 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\text{indefinido}","correct":false},{"latex":"-1","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1 - 1 = 0$.$exp$),
  ($id$exp0-h-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-cero$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula el valor de $k$ si $(x^2+1)^0 + k = 10$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"9","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1 + k = 10 \implies k = 9$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $2^{-3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{8}","correct":true},{"latex":"-8","correct":false},{"latex":"-6","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2^{-3} = \frac{1}{2^3} = \frac{1}{8}$. El signo del exponente no cambia el signo del resultado.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $x^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^2}","correct":true},{"latex":"-x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{x^2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^{-2} = \frac{1}{x^2}$. Un exponente negativo NO vuelve negativa a la base.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $5^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{5}","correct":true},{"latex":"-5","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"0","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^{-1} = \frac{1}{5^1} = \frac{1}{5}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $a^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{a}","correct":true},{"latex":"-a","correct":false},{"latex":"a","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{a}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$a^{-1} = \frac{1}{a}$, que es el recíproco de $a$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $10^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{100}","correct":true},{"latex":"-100","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false},{"latex":"-20","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$10^{-2} = \frac{1}{10^2} = \frac{1}{100}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Escribe con exponente positivo: $x^{-4}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-x^4","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{x^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^4}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Por definición $a^{-n} = \frac{1}{a^n}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $2^{-3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{8}","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"-8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{8}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2^{-3} = \frac{1}{2^3} = \frac{1}{8}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $3^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-9","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{9}","correct":false},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$3^{-2} = \frac{1}{3^2} = \frac{1}{9}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Escribe con exponente positivo: $y^{-6}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-y^6","correct":false},{"latex":"y^6","correct":false},{"latex":"-6y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{y^6}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Regla del exponente negativo: $\frac{1}{y^6}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $5^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-5","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{5}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{5}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^{-1} = \frac{1}{5^1} = \frac{1}{5}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Escribe con exponente positivo: $a^{-8}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-a^8","correct":false},{"latex":"a^8","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{a^8}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{a^8}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{a^8}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $4^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-16","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{16}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{16}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{4^2} = \frac{1}{16}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-f-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $10^{-3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-1000","correct":false},{"latex":"0.01","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{1000}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{1000}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{10^3} = \frac{1}{1000}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $3x^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3}{x^2}","correct":true},{"latex":"3x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"-3x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3x^2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Solo la $x$ tiene exponente negativo: $3 \cdot x^{-2} = \frac{3}{x^2}$. El 3 queda arriba.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2x)^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2x}","correct":true},{"latex":"-2x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{2}{x}","correct":false},{"latex":"2x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El exponente aplica a toda la base: $(2x)^{-1} = \frac{1}{2x}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(-2)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":true},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{4}","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"-4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(-2)^{-2} = \frac{1}{(-2)^2} = \frac{1}{4}$. El exponente par elimina el signo.$exp$)
INSERT INTO eqd.questions (id, section_id, subtema_id, law_id, difficulty, prompt, options, explanation)
VALUES
  ($id$expneg-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{1}{x^{-2}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"-x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{-2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{x^{-2}} = x^2$, porque un exponente negativo en el denominador sube al numerador.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(3^{-1})^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"-3","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se multiplican los exponentes: $(-1) \cdot (-1) = 1$, por lo que $3^1 = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica a exponente positivo: $\frac{1}{x^{-5}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^5}","correct":false},{"latex":"-x^5","correct":false},{"latex":"-5x","correct":false},{"latex":"x^5","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Subir una potencia del denominador invierte el signo del exponente: $x^5$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\left(\frac{2}{3}\right)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{9}{4}","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{4}{9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{4}{9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{9}{4}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se invierte la fracción y se eleva al cuadrado: $\left(\frac{3}{2}\right)^2 = \frac{9}{4}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $3x^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-3x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{3}{x^2}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El 3 no tiene exponente negativo: $\frac{3}{x^2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(3x)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3}{x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"-9x^2","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{9}{x^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9x^2}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Todo el paréntesis está afectado: $\frac{1}{(3x)^2} = \frac{1}{9x^2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^{-3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{64}","correct":false},{"latex":"-64","correct":false},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"64","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\left(\frac{4}{1}\right)^3 = 4^3 = 64$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{x^{-3}}{y^{-4}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x^3}{y^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{x^3}{y^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^3y^4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{y^4}{x^3}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se intercambian posiciones para hacer exponentes positivos: $\frac{y^4}{x^3}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $(-2)^{-3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{8}","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"-8","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{8}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{(-2)^3} = \frac{1}{-8} = -\frac{1}{8}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-m-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $(-2)^{-4}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"16","correct":false},{"latex":"-16","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{16}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{16}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Exponente par da positivo: $\frac{1}{(-2)^4} = \frac{1}{16}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $2^{-2} \cdot 2^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{8}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Suma de exponentes: $-2 + 3 = 1$, por lo que $2^1 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{x^2}{x^{-3}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^5","correct":true},{"latex":"x^{-1}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{-5}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Resta de exponentes: $2 - (-3) = 2 + 3 = 5$, por lo que $x^5$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $2^x = \frac{1}{8}$, ¿cuál es el valor de $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-3","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"-8","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1}{8} = \frac{1}{2^3} = 2^{-3}$, por lo que $x = -3$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(2x^2)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4x^4}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2x^4}","correct":false},{"latex":"4x^4","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{4}{x^4}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(2x^2)^{-2} = \frac{1}{(2x^2)^2} = \frac{1}{4x^4}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{3x^{-2}}{y^{-3}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3y^3}{x^2}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{3x^2}{y^3}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{3}{x^2 y^3}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{x^2}{3y^3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Los exponentes negativos cambian de lugar: $\frac{3x^{-2}}{y^{-3}} = 3 \cdot \frac{y^3}{x^2} = \frac{3y^3}{x^2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{a^{-2} + b^{-2}}{(ab)^{-1}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{ab}{a^2+b^2}","correct":false},{"latex":"a+b","correct":false},{"latex":"a^2+b^2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{a^2+b^2}{ab}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1/a^2 + 1/b^2}{1/(ab)} = \frac{(b^2+a^2)/(a^2b^2)}{1/(ab)} = \frac{a^2+b^2}{ab}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $\left(\frac{3}{5}\right)^{-3} \cdot \left(\frac{5}{3}\right)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3}{5}","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{25}{9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{5}{3}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\left(\frac{5}{3}\right)^3 \cdot \left(\frac{3}{5}\right)^2 = \frac{125}{27} \cdot \frac{9}{25} = \frac{5}{3}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(x^{-1} + y^{-1})^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{x+y}{xy}","correct":false},{"latex":"xy","correct":false},{"latex":"x+y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{xy}{x+y}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\left(\frac{1}{x} + \frac{1}{y}\right)^{-1} = \left(\frac{y+x}{xy}\right)^{-1} = \frac{xy}{x+y}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{2^{-1} + 3^{-1}}{2^{-1} - 3^{-1}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"-5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{5}{6}","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{1/2 + 1/3}{1/2 - 1/3} = \frac{5/6}{1/6} = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-10$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve para $x$: $4^{-x} = 64$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-\\frac{1}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"16","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"-3","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$4^{-x} = 4^3 \implies -x = 3 \implies x = -3$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{x^{-n} - y^{-n}}{x^{-n}y^{-n}}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{x^n-y^n}","correct":false},{"latex":"x^ny^n","correct":false},{"latex":"x^n - y^n","correct":false},{"latex":"y^n - x^n","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{\frac{1}{x^n} - \frac{1}{y^n}}{\frac{1}{x^ny^n}} = \frac{\frac{y^n-x^n}{x^ny^n}}{\frac{1}{x^ny^n}} = y^n - x^n$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula: $(2^{-2} - 3^{-2})^{-1}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{5}{36}","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\frac{36}{5}","correct":false},{"latex":"-1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{36}{5}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\left(\frac{1}{4} - \frac{1}{9}\right)^{-1} = \left(\frac{5}{36}\right)^{-1} = \frac{36}{5}$.$exp$),
  ($id$expneg-h-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$exponente-negativo$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\left(\frac{a^{-3}b^2}{a^2b^{-4}}\right)^{-2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{b^{12}}{a^{10}}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{a^6}{b^8}","correct":false},{"latex":"a^{10}b^{12}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{a^{10}}{b^{12}}","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Dentro: $a^{-3-2}b^{2-(-4)} = a^{-5}b^6$. Elevando a $-2$: $a^{10}b^{-12} = \frac{a^{10}}{b^{12}}$.$exp$),
