  ($id$faccom-m-11$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $3m(2x-1) - 5(2x-1)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(2x - 1)(3m + 5)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x - 1)(15m)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x + 1)(3m - 5)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x - 1)(3m - 5)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Factor común polinomio $(2x-1)$: $(2x-1)(3m-5)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-m-12$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza por agrupación: $ax + ay + bx + by$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x - y)(a - b)","correct":false},{"latex":"xy(a + b)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + y)(a - b)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + y)(a + b)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$a(x+y) + b(x+y) = (x+y)(a+b)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-m-13$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza por agrupación: $2x^3 - 3x^2 + 4x - 6$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(2x - 3)(x^2 - 2)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x - 3)(2x^2 + 2)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x + 3)(x^2 + 2)","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x - 3)(x^2 + 2)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^2(2x-3) + 2(2x-3) = (2x-3)(x^2+2)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $2x^3 + 4x^2 + 6x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2x(x^2 + 2x + 3)","correct":true},{"latex":"2(x^3 + 2x^2 + 3x)","correct":false},{"latex":"2x(x^2 + 2x + 6)","correct":false},{"latex":"2x^2(x + 2 + 3)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El máximo factor común es $2x$: $2x^3 + 4x^2 + 6x = 2x(x^2 + 2x + 3)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $ab + ac + ad$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"a(b + c + d)","correct":true},{"latex":"a(bcd)","correct":false},{"latex":"a(b + c) + d","correct":false},{"latex":"a(b + c + d + a)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El factor común es $a$: $ab + ac + ad = a(b + c + d)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $x(a + b) + y(a + b)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(a + b)(x + y)","correct":true},{"latex":"(a + b)(xy)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + y)(a + b + 1)","correct":false},{"latex":"(a + b)^2(x + y)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El factor común es $(a+b)$: $x(a+b) + y(a+b) = (a+b)(x+y)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $6x^2y + 9xy^2$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3xy(2x + 3y)","correct":true},{"latex":"3xy(2 + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"6xy(x + y)","correct":false},{"latex":"3x^2y^2(2 + 3)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$El máximo factor común es $3xy$: $6x^2y + 9xy^2 = 3xy(2x + 3y)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza por agrupación: $x^2 - 3x + 5x - 15$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x + 5)(x - 3)","correct":true},{"latex":"(x - 5)(x + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 5)(x + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x - 5)(x - 3)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Agrupa: $x(x-3) + 5(x-3) = (x-3)(x+5)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $x^{n+2} + 3x^n$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2(x^n + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"x^{2n}(1 + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"x^n(x + 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"x^n(x^2 + 3)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Extraemos la menor potencia $x^n$: $x^n(x^2+3)$.$exp$)
