  ($id$faccom-h-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza por agrupación: $x^3 + x^2 + x + 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x - 1)(x^2 + 1)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 1)^3","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 1)(x^2 - 1)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 1)(x^2 + 1)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^2(x+1) + 1(x+1) = (x+1)(x^2+1)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $2e^{2x} + 4e^x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2e^x(e^x + 4)","correct":false},{"latex":"2(e^{2x} + 2e^x)","correct":false},{"latex":"e^x(2e^x + 2)","correct":false},{"latex":"2e^x(e^x + 2)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Factor común $2e^x$: $2e^x(e^x+2)$.$exp$),
  ($id$faccom-h-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$factor-comun$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $x(a-b) + y(b-a)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(a - b)(x + y)","correct":false},{"latex":"(a + b)(x - y)","correct":false},{"latex":"(b - a)(x - y)","correct":false},{"latex":"(a - b)(x - y)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Como $(b-a) = -(a-b)$, reescribimos $x(a-b) - y(a-b) = (a-b)(x-y)$.$exp$),
