VALUES
  ($id$difcuad-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $x^4 - 16$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x^2 + 4)(x + 2)(x - 2)","correct":true},{"latex":"(x^2 + 4)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 2)^4","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^2 - 4)^2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^4 - 16 = (x^2)^2 - 4^2 = (x^2-4)(x^2+4)$. Y $x^2-4$ vuelve a factorizar: $(x+2)(x-2)(x^2+4)$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula usando diferencia de cuadrados: $101^2 - 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"10200","correct":true},{"latex":"10000","correct":false},{"latex":"10100","correct":false},{"latex":"10201","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$101^2 - 1 = 101^2 - 1^2 = (101+1)(101-1) = 102 \cdot 100 = 10200$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $a^2 - b^2 = 45$ y $a + b = 9$, ¿cuánto vale $a - b$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"5","correct":true},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"36","correct":false},{"latex":"45","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$a^2 - b^2 = (a+b)(a-b) = 45$. Como $a+b = 9$, entonces $9(a-b) = 45$, por lo que $a-b = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $9x^4 - 4$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(3x^2 + 2)(3x^2 - 2)","correct":true},{"latex":"(3x^2 + 2)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(3x^2 - 2)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(9x^2 + 2)(x^2 - 2)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$9x^4 - 4 = (3x^2)^2 - 2^2 = (3x^2+2)(3x^2-2)$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $(x + 1)^2 - 9$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x + 4)(x - 2)","correct":true},{"latex":"(x + 4)(x + 2)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x - 2)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 1)(x - 3)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(x+1)^2 - 9 = (x+1)^2 - 3^2 = [(x+1)+3][(x+1)-3] = (x+4)(x-2)$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-06$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza completamente: $x^4 - 81$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x^2 + 9)(x^2 - 9)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^2 - 9)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x + 3)^2(x - 3)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^2 + 9)(x + 3)(x - 3)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^4-81 = (x^2+9)(x^2-9) = (x^2+9)(x+3)(x-3)$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-07$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $\frac{4x^2}{9} - \frac{25}{16}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\left(\\frac{4x}{9} + \\frac{25}{16}\\right)\\left(\\frac{4x}{9} - \\frac{25}{16}\\right)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\left(\\frac{2x}{9} + \\frac{5}{16}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2x}{9} - \\frac{5}{16}\\right)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\left(\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{5}{4}\\right)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\left(\\frac{2x}{3} + \\frac{5}{4}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{5}{4}\\right)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Raíces: $\frac{2x}{3}$ y $\frac{5}{4}$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-08$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $x^{2n} - y^{2m}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(x^2 + y^2)(x^n - y^m)","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^n + y^m)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^n - y^m)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(x^n + y^m)(x^n - y^m)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sqrt{x^{2n}}=x^n$, $\sqrt{y^{2m}}=y^m \implies (x^n+y^m)(x^n-y^m)$.$exp$),
  ($id$difcuad-h-09$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$productos-notables$sub$, $law$diferencia-cuadrados$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Factoriza: $4^x - 9$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"(2^x - 3)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(2x + 3)(2x - 3)","correct":false},{"latex":"(4^{x/2} + 3)^2","correct":false},{"latex":"(2^x + 3)(2^x - 3)","correct":true}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Como $4^x = (2^x)^2$, tenemos $(2^x+3)(2^x-3)$.$exp$),
